	<key>PayloadDescription</key>
	<string>Pre-approves the TimeTracker agent (bundle id TimeTracker, team P3KX4CDFN4) for Accessibility (window titles) and Automation (Apple Events) of the browsers, Adobe, Office, iWork and Apple apps it reads the current page or document from. Read-only: the agent asks which page or file is in front and never changes anything. Must be delivered by a user-approved MDM; installing it by hand grants nothing. Screen Recording, Camera and Microphone are not requested.</string>
